##############################################################################
# Downloaded pbrt-v4-scenes collection (local only - see pbrt_scenes/README.md)
##############################################################################

# Full scene bundles fetched from github.com/mmp/pbrt-v4-scenes, each in its
# own folder with third-party geometry/textures. Not committed - point
# RAY_TRACER_PBRT_DIR at one of these folders instead (see the README).
pbrt_scenes/contemporary-bathroom/
pbrt_scenes/barcelona-pavilion/
pbrt_scenes/sssdragon/
pbrt_scenes/ganesha/
pbrt_scenes/sportscar/
pbrt_scenes/zero-day/
# Companion tree assets for barcelona-pavilion (referenced as ../landscape/
# from its .pbrt files) - only the ~46 files it actually needs, not the
# full ~1.3GB landscape/ folder from the same upstream repo.
pbrt_scenes/landscape/

##############################################################################
# Downloaded mesh-gallery scene assets (local only)
##############################################################################

# Large third-party "whole environment" scenes (Sponza, Bistro, Rungholt,
# etc. - scenes_mesh_gallery.h's own gallery), same "not committed, download
# locally" reasoning as pbrt_scenes/ above - several GB combined, unlike the
# small statue-scale .obj models (bunny, armadillo, ...) that !models/*.obj
# further up exists to keep tracked. Overrides that broader exception and
# !models/sponza_textures|bistro_textures/**/*.png below it (later patterns
# win) for these specific files/directories only.
models/bistro_exterior.obj
models/bistro_textures/
models/breakfast_room.obj
models/breakfast_room.mtl
models/exterior.mtl
models/fireplace_room.obj
models/fireplace_room.mtl
models/gallery.obj
models/gallery.mtl
models/lost_empire.obj
models/lost_empire.mtl
models/powerplant.obj
models/powerplant.mtl
models/rungholt.obj
models/rungholt.mtl
models/salle_de_bain.obj
models/salle_de_bain.mtl
models/san_miguel.obj
models/san_miguel.mtl
models/sibenik_cathedral.obj
models/sibenik_cathedral.mtl
models/sponza.obj
models/sponza.mtl
models/sponza_textures/
models/vokselia_spawn.obj
models/vokselia_spawn.mtl

