*.py
total.txt
*.txt
# CMakeLists.txt files are real, hand-written build files, not stray logs -
# the blanket *.txt rule above was catching them incidentally (confirmed:
# tests/CMakeLists.txt was already untracked because of this, despite being
# a real, documented (README.md's "Option B: CMake (manual)") build file).
!CMakeLists.txt
# Generated/preprocessed test artifacts
tests/generated/

# Stray output dir from RenderIntegrationTest.NonExistentDirectory
/nonexistent_dir/
